WEBVTT

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.130
Momo!

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:41.680
Hm?

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:43.680
Oh, Nana.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.040
What is it that has you so flustered?

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:12.830
She's sleeping soundly.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:15.530
It's because she woke up early and played so much.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.550
It really is convenient having you around, Rito.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.010
What's that supposed to mean?

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.560
You're the one who bumped into me first!

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.680
