00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.680
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.680
<b>「Mother</b>

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.680
<b>「Mother</b>

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.680
<b>~An Angel Too Beautiful~」</b>

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.680
<b>~An Angel Too Beautiful~」</b>

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:24.730
Huh?

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:26.960
You bumped into me first!

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.590
What did you say?!

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:31.420
You wanna go, huh!?

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.330
Whoa... Looks like those delinquents are fighting.

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:38.280
Mikan, it's dangerous so let's go that way.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.520
Shut yer trap!

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.690
I beg you to stop.

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:49.710
Quarrelling is a pointless endeavour that only results in harming yourselves.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.620
If you but acknowledge each others' good points,

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.590
surely you can reconcile your differences.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:09.270
Well, now that I look closely, your hair looks pretty good.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:12.270
Those spikes on your shoulders do, too.

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:13.850
That person...

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:16.900
S-She has a sparkling aura...

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:25.580
Pleased to meet you Yuuki Rito-san, Yuuki Mikan-san.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.370
W-What?!

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:32.250
Such a beautiful voice, it puts one at ease...

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:37.270
U-Um... Who are you...?

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:42.890
Even if you hide your face, I can sense your aura of transcendent beauty!

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:47.140
The god inside me has begun swelling up!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:50.690
Good lady, by all means please have a cup of tea with me!

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.440
Oh my, what a passionate person.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:03:01.950
If only you would employ such passion toward the world, you could probably undo much sorrow.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.290
I see.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:14.170
So there's something even one such as myself can do?

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:20.380
I have taken your kind words to heart, good lady.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.760
I suppose I shall go clean some garbage now.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:26.890
So, I bid you adieu.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.510
He became {more }pure?!

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.560
I've never seen the principle so calm before...

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.400
Wait... That hair colour...

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.690
That's right!

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:40.580
That person is... our Mama!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.390
Lala...'s Mama?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.710
Eh? Your Mother is coming, Lala-san?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.460
Yeah, that's right!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:58.720
Mama is always super busy doing political work for Papa,

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:02.750
but she made time for half a day to come visit us!

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:06.440
Oh? It's been a while since you've seen your mother, hasn't it?

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:09.520
I guess me shrinking was a good thing!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.940
I'll invite you to go shopping next time then, okay?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.200
I'm sorry!

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:20.460
Zastin and the others wouldn't let me say anything until after she arrived for security reasons!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.710
No, don't worry about it.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:24.300
Say hello to your mother for me.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.550
Yep! See you later!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.520
Lala-san's mother, huh?

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.330
I wonder what kind of person she is. Right, Maron?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:39.000
Yuuki-kun gets to meet Lala-san's mother.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.720
My name is Sephie Michaela Deviluke.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:52.920
Thank you for taking care of my daughters.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.850
Ah. No, I should be the one to say thanks.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.780
I'm sorry.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:00.430
I would have liked to visit sooner, but...

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.530
No, no.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.530
It's okay, I understand that you're very busy.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.250
You seem to be doing well, Lala.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.200
Yeah!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.620
My power is returning a little bit at a time,

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.790
so I'll be back to my original appearance before you know it.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.360
Mother!

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:17.250
Oh, my. You're as spoiled as ever I see, Nana.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:22.350
Earth clothing suits you well, Momo.

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.260
I'm so happy to hear you say that, mother.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.320
Oh, I almost forgot, mother.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:29.330
You shouldn't get close to that guy, he's a beast.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.220
Hey!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.500
Hey, Nana!

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.190
But it's the truth, big sister.

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:38.410
Besides, it'd be bad if Rito tripped like usual and saw mother's face, wouldn't it?

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.440
Hmm... I wonder.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.140
Why would it be bad?

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:45.240
Being too beautiful is problematic.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:51.950
Sephie-sama is the last descendant of the Charmians, a race that possesses the most beautiful appearances and voices in the universe.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:06:01.710
That beauty reaches the level of an ability, and any male that sees her face has their heart stolen instantly and becomes a beast.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.120
Amazing.

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.240
She's too popular, so it causes problems.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:07.160
It's far beyond that level!

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:11.020
Any man will be turned into a huge pervert, like that principal.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:13.350
If we look at the cause of the prolonged galactic war,

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:18.690
it's said by some that the root was complication caused by a quarrel over a single Charmian.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:21.390
That sure changes how you think about the galactic war, huh.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:28.490
I myself have been subjected to many dangerous situations because of this trait of Charmians.

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:34.240
And the one who saved me from it was Gid Lucione Deviluke.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.890
Their father did?

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:40.250
I get the feeling he'd be the first one to rush you, though.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.850
So that's why you cover your face.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:42.870
Yes.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:47.510
If I cover my face, that Charmian trait can be controlled to a certain degree.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:53.030
I'm so glad my daughters didn't inherit that trait.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.260
Beauty is a sin.

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:58.020
I see.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.110
I had assumed that Lala and the others' mother was Devilukean.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.800
Then Nana-san, your ability...

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:10.740
I think mother's Charmian ability combined with the
Devilukean ability and changed into something different.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.320
Oh...

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.320
Oh!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:17.170
Sephie-san, since you're here why don't we have a meal together?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.330
Is that really okay?

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.420
Of course!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:20.290
Right, Rito?

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.830
That's right. By all means, please.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:31.060
I never thought mother would come to Earth.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:33.450
Of course I'm happy, but...

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.100
I have to be extra careful!

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.350
After all, mother is the type that completely opposes a harem!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:44.760
Even father, who is the supreme ruler of the
universe doesn't stand a chance against mother!

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:48.860
The risk of mother finding out about my harem plan is too high!

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.050
For now, I'll just have to wait and see.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:55.410
At the very least until I have one or two people co-operating with me.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.080
Isn't this good, Momo?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.860
It's been a while since you've seen your mother, right?

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:03.540
Y-Yeah, that's true.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.780
I'll take care of the rest,

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:07.380
so you just go and take it easy with your mother.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.230
Ah, no. I-

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.430
Thanks for the food!

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.140
It's delicious!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:25.500
Momo-san has been giving me a hand recently, so it's a big help.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.400
She was the one who made that, as well.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.290
That's impressive, Momo.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.400
Yeah, I guess.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.030
Are you two also helping out all the time?

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.120
Good grief...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.310
E-Even I-

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.360
What are you laughing about?!

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.500
S-Sorry!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:47.250
Hey, Nana. I'm always telling you to watch your mouth, aren't I?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:50.240
But, mother...

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:04.980
I didn't know that not being able to get close to Rito-san was this stressful...

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:08.480
Momo-san, are you worrying about something?

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.260
Mi-Mikan-san?!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:11.980
I wonder...

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.500
It's been a while since you've seen your mother, so you're probably shy, right?

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.200
Eh?

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:21.700
I can't tell if Mikan-san's intuition is sharp or dull...

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.460
Hey, Nana-san was calling for you.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:28.070
Big sister and mother are saying they want to get in the bath together since it's been a while.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:28.790
Eh?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.170
Celine! It's time for the little ones to go to sleep!

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:34.930
Come here!

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:45.250
Ah! Momo, your boobs are so soft!

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:48.380
Big sister, please cut it out!

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.420
There! Squeezy, squeeze!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.780
So soft and jiggly! {When did Lala turn into Risa?}

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.550
It's not like being big makes them good, right?

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:57.320
You think so too, don't you Mikan?

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.280
Y-Yeah...

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:03.170
At any rate, I was really surprised.

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:06.500
I didn't think you had a hot spring like this in your digital safari, Nana-san.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.150
There are animals that like hot springs, too.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.290
I made it at big sister's request.

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:15.360
Mother really is late, though...

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:17.850
I wonder if she's taking her time undressing.

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.890
Peke was helping her, so maybe they're just talking.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:25.270
Actually, is it really okay for me to have come here?

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.480
It is a family gathering, after all.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.200
It's fine!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:32.010
You're like family too, Mikan!

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:33.430
Just so.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:35.330
I-Is that so?

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.670
Sephie-san probably takes off her veil only when bathing, right?

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:41.520
Will I be okay if I look?

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:43.360
Ah, that's no problem.

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:46.980
Only men are affected by the charm.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.510
I see.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:50.790
I'm kind of looking forward to it, but I'm nervous at the same time.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:53.360
Is Rito-san in his room?

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.300
Yeah.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:57.510
He said he'd put Celine to sleep while we're in the bath.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:02.090
The power of the charm, huh?

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:06.010
If Rito-san were to see mother's face, I wonder what would happen.

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:11.520
It's difficult to imagine, but would Rito lose his reason and become a beast...?

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:16.190
Could that be potentially useful in making Rito-san a carnivore?

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:18.120
Ah, that's no good.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:22.470
If that happened, Rito-san would only fall in love with mother.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:25.200
Just like that, the plan would be failure.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.380
They're swaying around...

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.170
Is she trying to pick a fight?

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:33.920
Celine!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.920
You have to go to sleep!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:44.810
So, Nana-sama and Momo-sama appear to be enjoying life on Earth.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:47.040
Is that so? I'm glad to hear that.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:48.270
Thank you, Peke.

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:51.880
Would you like to leave your veil, as well?

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:55.230
I'll leave it on until the hot spring, just in case.

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:57.110
Let us be on our way, then.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:57.940
Yes.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:01.210
Agh. Celine, where are you?

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.910
Celine!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:05.780
Huh?

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.030
R-Rito-dono, why are you here?!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.290
Uh, I-I was-

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:18.670
Sephie-sama!?

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:27.120
A-Are you okay, Sephie-sama!?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.430
Yes. H-Huh?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.430
I-I'm sorry-

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:36.100
Ah! Rito-san, you mustn't stand up right now-

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.090
