00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.090
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.090
<b>「Charm</b>

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.090
<b>「Charm</b>

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.090
<b>~The Great Mother~」</b>

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.090
<b>~The Great Mother~」</b>

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:09.600
So in other words, the charm is not just the beauty you can see?

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.090
That's right.

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:12.810
According to scholars' research,

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.940
there may be a secret within the pheromones of a pure Charmian.

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:21.570
And that has an effect on those who see them and turns them into a beast...

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:28.390
So Nana-san and Momo-san's abilities were
affected by that trait... but what about Lala-san?

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.240
Me? I'm normal!

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.960
If anything, I'm like my Papa!

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:40.460
Even though she looks like mother, among us three sisters, Lala has the most Devilukean power.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:46.510
I think that big sister's genius intellect comes from mother, though.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:49.800
Celine?!

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.180
H-Hey!?

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.940
Why is Celine here?!

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:56.770
Wasn't Rito-san supposed to be putting her to sleep?

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:04.300
H-He's been completely overtaken by my beauty!

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.240
I must escape!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.170
At this rate, I...

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:10.040
Even though I'm a queen...

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.990
Even though I'm a wife...

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:16.430
I'll be violated!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.760
Sephie-sama! Run now while you have the chance!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.130
Thank you, Peke!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.810
Geez, why does this happen to me?

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:34.260
I hate myself for being too beautiful.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:37.730
Why? Why does this-

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.460
Oh, my...

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.820
Nana's friends...

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.110
Rito-dono, please calm down!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.990
Sephie-sama is someone's wife!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:55.790
What's more, you're supposed to be Lala's fiancée!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:58.390
I can't breathe. Peke, stop it!

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.620
No! I won't stop!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:02.460
You've lost your reason and turned into a beast!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.920
Eh? Did you just say my name?

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:07.680
You still have your reason?

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:09.120
Of course I do!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.970
I'm trying to tell you I'm in my right mind!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:14.710
But your face just turned bright red, didn't it?

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:19.180
Of course it did, from having a pretty person like that naked except for a towel in front of me!

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:26.190
No! Stay away!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:31.950
The animals are going crazy from having been affected by the charm!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.570
Sephie-san, this way!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.200
N-No!

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:40.120
If I go that way, you'll push me down and **** or **** me! {censor beeps}

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.940
I'm in my right mind, so just hurry up and come this way!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:44.380
Eh?

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:48.960
You weren't affected, even though you saw my face?

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.910
I wasn't unaffected.

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:54.260
Even now, I'm struggling to avoid direct eye contact.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.140
Sephie-san!

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:13.910
No!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:20.590
Hey! Let her go!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.170
Sephie-sama!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.440
Rito-dono!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:35.010
Get Sephie-sama away while you have the chance!

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:38.970
S-Sephie-san, let's go that way!

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.060
Hurry!

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:46.770
These straightforward eyes...

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.650
For now, let's hide in the steam of this hot spring.

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:02.950
Y-Yes.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:11.170
The charm's power really doesn't affect you, does it?

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:15.220
You have a strong, unshakable conviction.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:19.200
Your course of action is another story, though.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.390
You're just like him... My husband.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.410
Me?! That's not true at all!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.690
I'm constantly lost.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:31.860
People without conviction just go
along with the flow, never getting lost.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:38.370
The reason you're lost is because of something you believe to be right.

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:44.450
And that is connected to your sincerity.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:49.920
I can understand my daughters' feelings that draw them to you.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:52.500
I am their mother, after all.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.050
It's easy for me to realise that much.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:02.090
Maybe that's all the more reason for
me to leave the three of them to you.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:03.020
That's-!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:06.720
Sephie-san, why are you saying something that sounds like the harem plan?!

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.610
It was a joke.

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:12.820
Wait... What is the harem plan?

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.070
Peke! Which way did Mama run?

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.040
If I remember correctly, that way!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.580
Dammit! I told the animals not to approach the hot spring!

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.290
Mother!

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:30.060
Rito, why are you with mother?

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.000
Why, you!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.380
You've become a beast, haven't you?!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.130
Get away from my mother!

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:40.140
Surprisingly, Rito-dono was able to keep his
reason even after seeing Sephie-sama's face!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:40.820
Oh, my!

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:41.800
Amazing!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.500
As expected of Rito!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.140
Really?

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.980
Wait... Those are my panties!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.850
Why do you have those on your head, you bastard!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.510
Hey Nana, stop it!

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:54.070
Yeah!

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:12.810
I'm sorry that he's this kind of brother...

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:13.840
It's okay.

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:18.970
What a wonderful person your big brother is.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:31.690
Sephie-sama, the mothership has arrived to pick you up.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:33.190
Thank you, Zastin.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:36.090
Are you going home already, mother?

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:38.100
It's not like we can't still talk, right?

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:40.320
I'll make time to come visit again some time.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:42.830
I've come to like this place as well, after all.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:47.310
You shouldn't push yourself until you
return to your regular body, okay Lala?

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.830
Yes!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.480
I-I'm sorry about all the things that happened.

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:54.530
It's okay, it was enjoyable.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.020
I'm so relieved.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:20:00.090
In any case, it ended without mother finding anything out.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.720
I have to keep doing my best for the harem plan from now on, too!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.670
Momo, please take care of your body as well.

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:10.970
Yes! Please come again any time, mother!

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:14.060
Rito-san is a good person, isn't he?

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:20.990
I believe that you should give maximum effort for the things you want.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.860
That's what I love about you.

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:25.730
Because I was that way, too.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.680
Do it however you wish.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:35.290
If your heart is okay with it, that is.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:38.080
Goodbye, Momo.

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:43.710
Goodbye, mother!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:46.040
Rito-san?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:46.800
Yes?

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:50.810
Please take care of my daughters from now on.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.260
She found out.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:08.430
Ah... She already went home.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.610
Nana, are you getting homesick?

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:12.040
Of course not!

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:14.450
What are you saying, big sister!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:21.250
W-Well... I do seem to have mother's permission...

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.010
So I should keep a positive attitude.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.100
Rito-san?

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:32.520
Eh?

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.810
Ah, hello? Mother?

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:41.800
Yeah.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:45.780
Well, it's not like I really have something to ask, though.

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:51.030
I just wanted to hear your voice.

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:54.250
Now then, shall we return?

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:54.910
Yes.

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:01.630
Good grief...

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:04.900
What kind of adults are you, gathering up and chasing after a kid?

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:06.630
Talk about lame.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:09.480
So, are you from this planet?

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:11.660
N-No.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:15.600
I come from a race of wanderers who have no home planet.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.750
Well, not like it matters.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:19.500
You should be grateful.

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:24.110
Thanks to the fact I coincidentally came to this planet for training, you were saved.

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:27.520
You...! You're fine, even if you look at me?

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:29.140
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:32.720
I'm asking if you're fine even after looking at my beautiful face!

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:33.450
Huh?!

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:37.570
Are you really calling yourself beautiful, even though you're just a little girl!?

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:39.840
You're smaller than I am!

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:43.300
Just who do you think I am?!

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:44.670
As if I'd know, you idiot!

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:47.180
If it bothers you, why don't you tell me?

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:48.300
Who are you?!

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:51.710
I am Gid Lucione Deviluke!

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:55.720
I am the man who will suppress the violence in the universe and stand at the top!

00:22:56.710 --> 00:23:05.820
Just like the eyes of the man who first looked straight at me, unbeguiled by my charm...

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:15.620
Give it your best, my daughters.
